{"parse": {"title": "Malevolent Mage", "pageid": 80120, "revid": 15357589, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{external|rs=Infernal Mage (elite)}}\n{{Infobox Monster\n|name = Malevolent Mage\n|image = [[File:Malevolent Mage.png|150px]]\n|release = [[15 September]] [[2016]]\n|update = Superior Slayer Encounters\n|members = Yes\n|combat = 162\n|size = 2\n|examine = The evil that men do lives on and on.\n|xpbonus = 0\n|max hit = 20\n|aggressive = No\n|poisonous = No\n|attack style = [[Magic]]\n|attack speed = 4\n|slaylvl = 45\n|slayxp = 1750\n|cat = Infernal Mages\n|assignedby = vannaka, Mortimer\n|hitpoints = 175\n|att = 1\n|str = 1\n|def = 135\n|mage = 175\n|range = 1\n|attbns = 0\n|strbns = 0\n|amagic = 0\n|mbns = 0\n|arange = 0\n|rngbns = 0\n|dstab = 0\n|dslash = 0\n|dcrush = 0\n|dmagic = 75\n|dlight = 0\n|dstandard = 0\n|dheavy = 0\n|poisonresistance = 100\n|venomresistance = 100\n|immuneburn = Immune to weak burns\n|id = 7396\n|leagueRegion = Morytania\n}}\nThe '''malevolent mage''' is a [[superior]] variant of the [[infernal mage]]. It has a chance of spawning after purchasing the unlock ''Bigger and Badder'' for 50 [[Slayer reward point]]s from any [[Slayer master]].\n\n==Drops==\n''In addition to 100% drops and tertiary drops, superior slayer monsters will always roll 3 additional items, of which only 1 roll may be from the superior unique table. The other rolls are performed on the regular counterpart's table; their displayed drop chances represent a single roll.''\n\n{{DropLogProject|kills=31289}}\n\n{{Average drop value}}\n\n===Pre-roll===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Lava battlestaff|quantity=1|rarity=1/1000|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Mystic boots (dark)|quantity=1|rarity=1/512|raritynotes={{NamedRef|Drop Rates V2}}|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Mystic hat (dark)|quantity=1|rarity=1/512|raritynotes={{CiteForum|author=Envision|url=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/108912|title=Drop Rates V2|postdate=22 April 2014|name=Drop Rates V2}}|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===100%===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bones|quantity=1|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Staves===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Staff|quantity=1|rarity=8/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Staff of fire|quantity=1|rarity=1/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Elemental runes===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Earth rune|quantity=10|rarity=6/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Fire rune|quantity=10|rarity=6/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Earth rune|quantity=36|rarity=4/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Air rune|quantity=10|rarity=3/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Water rune|quantity=10|rarity=3/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Air rune|quantity=18|rarity=2/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Water rune|quantity=18|rarity=2/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Earth rune|quantity=18|rarity=2/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Fire rune|quantity=18|rarity=2/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Catalytic runes===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Mind rune|quantity=18|rarity=2/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Body rune|quantity=18|rarity=2/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Blood rune|quantity=4|rarity=2/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Death rune|quantity=7|rarity=18/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Coins===\n''The overall chance of rolling a coin drop is 44/128 with an average value of {{Coins|4}}.''\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=1|rarity=19/128|gemw=No|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=2|rarity=14/128|gemw=No|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=4|rarity=8/128|gemw=No|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=29|rarity=3/128|gemw=No|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Nothing===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Nothing|quantity=1|rarity=1/8|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Fire ruby|quantity=1|rarity=1/64|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Superior Slayer tertiary===\n{{SuperiorDropTable|45}}\n\n==Collection log==\nMalevolent Mages have 7 [[collection log]] items.\n{{Sync}}\n{{Collection log list|cname1=Mist battlestaff|cname2=Dust battlestaff|cname3=Eternal gem|cname4=Imbued heart|cname5=Mystic boots (dark)|cname6=Mystic hat (dark)|cname7=Fire ruby}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 23 February 2017\n|update = Shift-Click Drop & QoL\n|poll = Old School Content Poll 50: Models, Anims and More\n|change = The malevolent mage was given a [[graphical update]] to be more distinguishable from their regular variant.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n===Gallery (historical)===\n{|style=\"text-align: center\" cellpadding=\"15\"\n|[[File:Infernal Mage.png|center|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Malevolent Mage.png|center|300x150px]]\n|-\n|15 September 2016 –<br/>23 February 2017\n|23 February 2017 –<br/>present\n|}\n\n==Trivia==\n*The examine text refers to the song \"The Evil That Men Do\" by Iron Maiden.\n\n{{Slayer monsters}}\n[[Category:Slayer monsters that can only be fought on task]]\n[[Category:Monsters that take priority in combat]]"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:16.555088+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Lava_battlestaff\" title=\"Lava battlestaff\"><img alt=\"Lava battlestaff.png: Malevolent Mage drops Lava battlestaff with rarity 3 × 1/1,000 in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Lava_battlestaff.png?6592f\" decoding=\"async\" l